# the-sweeper

The collections part never hears its command, the clock may reach the purge timeout at any 
moment, and the silent part may come back at any moment too. The race is a late confirmation 
against the capitulation: the sweeper gives up after the retries are spent, and the answer 
it gave up on may be on its way. 

